Acceptance criteria:
  Every CLI option has an identified GUI control.
  Recording and model setup have usable graphical actions.
  Live left/right eye thresholds affect both expressions and action detection.
  No camera starts automatically; raw modes require explicit acknowledgement.
  Completed evidence is separate from user approval.

Completion evidence:
  All 45 runtime options have native controls; recording and model helpers are included.
  Full suite: 224 passed; Ruff passed. README/book paths and fences checked.
  Actual dark/light/compact/tutorial screenshots inspected; handbook: 245 pages, 97 diagrams,
  zero Mermaid failures and zero overflowing pages.
  Real recorded-input GUI replay and live tuning succeeded; no live camera was opened.
  User visual/usability approval: PENDING REVIEW, separate from engineering completion.
